      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really hate going to the doctor and it's so expensive right now. i just want to know if it's safe to take a standard dose just to see if it helps. like, if i just take 100mg twice a day is that gonna mess up my kidneys more or is it fine? i'm just trying to manage it at home for now.",
